# SMSW—Store Machine Status Word -- override
# 'DEST := CR0[15:0]' (v1 writes 16 bits for the register form too), #GP(0)
# with CR4.UMIP at CPL > 0. Opcodes: the page's 'r32/m16' and 'r64/m16'
# rows are the same encoding as 'r/m16'.
@opcodes
0F 01 /4 | SMSW r/m16 | M | Valid | Valid
@operation
IF CR4.UMIP = 1 AND CPL > 0 THEN #GP(0); FI;
DEST := CR0 AND FFFFH;
